WEBVTT

00:00.520 --> 00:04.410
Man, today was hot! Want some barley tea?

00:04.410 --> 00:06.360
We have permission to raid the fridge.

00:06.360 --> 00:08.940
Okay, I'll pour it, then.

00:12.110 --> 00:13.740
Not your first time, huh?

00:15.260 --> 00:17.830
I use this kitchen a lot.

00:19.770 --> 00:24.620
Ms. Amane, how much do 
you know about Mr. Maou?

00:26.260 --> 00:30.380
Only that he's not from Earth,
and also not human.

00:30.810 --> 00:34.860
Since he can use magic, 
he's probably a demon or something.

00:35.210 --> 00:37.450
As I see it, I'd say he
fought with Yusa and her group,

00:37.450 --> 00:39.890
fled to this world when he lost,

00:39.890 --> 00:42.940
and then got stuck doing part-time 
work because his magic was gone.

00:42.940 --> 00:44.070
That's about it.

00:44.730 --> 00:48.650
You've already guessed 
almost his entire past.

00:49.370 --> 00:53.030
Have I? It was just conjecture.

00:53.030 --> 00:54.260
Say—

00:54.260 --> 00:59.160
Well, I guess I'll tell you... but only you.

01:02.200 --> 01:05.660
I've made it so no one can eavesdrop on us.

01:07.900 --> 01:10.540
Then I'd like to ask you some questions.

01:10.540 --> 01:13.300
Wow, you're gonna take notes? 
You're serious.

01:13.690 --> 01:16.180
So, what would you like to know?

01:16.180 --> 01:19.160
Ms. Amane, how are you related 
to the Tree of Life on Earth

01:19.160 --> 01:22.310
and the sephiroth born from it?

01:22.720 --> 01:24.550
Jumping in the deep end, eh?

01:24.870 --> 01:29.310
You could say I'm like Alas Ramus and Acieth.

01:30.060 --> 01:33.840
But I wasn't born directly 
from sephiroth like they were.

01:33.840 --> 01:37.430
My dad came from a sephirah, 
but my mother is human,

01:37.430 --> 01:39.570
so I guess you can think of me as biracial.

01:39.880 --> 01:43.450
And Aunt Mikitty is Dad's older sister,

01:43.450 --> 01:45.830
so she's the child of a sephirah, like him.

01:45.830 --> 01:48.530
And due to her role—

01:52.110 --> 01:53.340
Auntie!

01:53.740 --> 01:56.970
Miss Chiho Sasaki, let me ask you one thing.

01:57.400 --> 02:01.970
Even if you learn the truth, you will
 not be able to change anything.

02:01.970 --> 02:04.470
Do you still want to know everything?

02:06.200 --> 02:09.980
Yes, even if I regret it later.

02:10.370 --> 02:13.730
If I run from knowing, I won't get anywhere.

02:14.100 --> 02:17.630
I want to stay friends with 
the people I love forever.

02:17.630 --> 02:19.990
That's why I'm here.

02:38.800 --> 02:40.890
<b>The Devil is a Part-Timer! Season 2</b>

03:50.680 --> 03:54.290
Defeating a Malebranche leader is 
a promising start, isn't it?

03:53.120 --> 03:58.050
m 370 218 l 609 218 609 245 370 245

03:54.670 --> 03:58.050
<b>The Devil Loses His Standing</b>

03:54.670 --> 03:58.050
<b>The Devil Loses His Standing</b>

03:54.670 --> 03:58.050
It proves that the Hero's 
presence is helping the troops.

03:58.550 --> 04:01.170
I don't see why we had to kill them.

04:01.170 --> 04:05.430
It was necessary in order to 
save the Emperor-Unifier, clearly.

04:09.870 --> 04:11.210
I'll be brief:

04:11.210 --> 04:15.810
It was the Emilia who slew one of your
leaders, and she's on her way to Heavensky.

04:15.810 --> 04:19.940
Emilia is in Ente Isla? But why?

04:20.300 --> 04:23.650
I assume Heaven's objectives are 
to further weaken the demon realm

04:23.650 --> 04:27.450
and to boost humans' faith 
by subjugating demons.

04:27.960 --> 04:31.190
That would be why Olba has 
Emilia heading the army.

04:31.980 --> 04:36.710
First she acts all superior, 
then she drags us into this mess...

04:36.710 --> 04:40.820
This week His Majesty works 
the morning shift on Monday,

04:40.820 --> 04:43.090
an evening shift on Tuesday, 
the full day Wednesday,

04:43.090 --> 04:45.510
the early shift plus a supervisory 
late shift on Thursday,

04:45.510 --> 04:47.090
and noon to closing on Friday.

04:47.090 --> 04:49.270
Then he's off Saturday, 
works all of Sunday,

04:49.270 --> 04:52.320
then he's off the following Monday 
with the early shift on Tuesday...

04:52.980 --> 04:55.950
That would make the greatest 
obstacles finding a sub for Sunday

04:55.950 --> 04:58.390
and dealing with Thursday's 
supervisory shift.

04:58.800 --> 05:02.280
I believe staffing was already 
going to be light those days.

05:02.280 --> 05:06.460
We should assume that the easiest time 
for him to make a move is Thursday afternoon.

05:07.610 --> 05:11.560
Where is the Emperor-Unifier? 
I hope you haven't killed him.

05:11.560 --> 05:15.750
No, sir. As the symbol Efzahan 
fights for, he's too important.

05:15.750 --> 05:20.750
We've confined him in the Cloud Retreat 
so that he won't be dosed with our magic.

05:20.750 --> 05:24.720
Lead me there. I'm going to speak with him.

05:24.720 --> 05:25.580
Yes, sir.

05:26.210 --> 05:27.380
Screw that!

05:27.380 --> 05:29.610
It's for your own safety.

05:29.610 --> 05:33.270
Don't give me that. 
I've never been so disgraced!

05:33.270 --> 05:37.660
Says the guy who's done nothing 
but eat and sleep since he got here.

05:37.660 --> 05:40.770
Albert! Don't talk to 
me like I'm Urushihara!

05:40.770 --> 05:42.760
There are some things 
you just shouldn't say!

05:42.760 --> 05:46.370
It's the only way. You'd be 
no help whatsoever in a fight.

05:46.370 --> 05:49.160
Which means you need to 
stay here and wait for us.

05:49.160 --> 05:50.660
Shit...

05:51.270 --> 05:52.370
Hey, Acieth!

05:52.370 --> 05:53.170
Mmm?

05:53.170 --> 05:55.910
Why isn't my magic coming back?!

05:56.680 --> 05:57.650
Shrimp...

05:57.650 --> 05:59.050
What about shrimp?!

05:59.050 --> 06:02.290
Maybe we'll know if we eat salted shrimp.

06:04.570 --> 06:07.430
Stop! I understand how you feel,
 but you can't do that!

06:07.430 --> 06:08.680
Lemme go, Suzuno!

06:08.680 --> 06:11.680
Darn... no shrimp...

06:14.930 --> 06:18.560
Ow! I get it, I get it!

06:18.560 --> 06:21.400
Keep your cool. It's not 
as though this is your fault.

06:21.400 --> 06:25.680
But if I don't fight, what was 
the point of skipping shifts to come here?!

06:25.680 --> 06:30.600
I don't want you to fight without 
access to your power and get hurt.

06:30.600 --> 06:33.450
I vow to bring everyone back safely.

06:40.470 --> 06:44.660
We've let your power carry us so far.

06:44.660 --> 06:47.460
Just this once, I want you 
to let us return the favor.

06:47.910 --> 06:52.030
This is my recommendation as 
a general of the new Devil's army.

06:52.030 --> 06:53.470
Suzuno...

06:53.470 --> 06:59.540
I don't know what happened in Japan, 
but <i>I</i> never surrendered to your army.

06:59.540 --> 07:04.110
I know. We just happen to have 
the same goal of rescuing Emi.

07:04.640 --> 07:07.110
The more companions the better right now.

07:07.110 --> 07:08.950
"Companions," eh?

07:09.820 --> 07:12.580
By the way, I've been 
meaning to ask you something.

07:13.690 --> 07:19.130
Why have you and Emerada let Emi 
live in Japan without defeating me?

07:19.130 --> 07:23.000
I figured you two might come kill me 
there and just not tell her first.

07:23.980 --> 07:26.410
It's not like we didn't consider that.

07:26.410 --> 07:27.580
So you did.

07:28.010 --> 07:33.760
I don't know Eme's thought process, but I'm
 sure she respected Emilia's wishes.

07:33.760 --> 07:38.040
Beyond that, just be grateful to 
Adramelech and that Sasaki girl.

07:38.040 --> 07:39.990
What are you talking about?

07:39.990 --> 07:42.640
Come on, it's time to go.

07:42.640 --> 07:47.230
Hey, I hear the volunteer army and 
the Malebranche clashed recently,

07:47.230 --> 07:49.990
and a Malebranche leader got defeated.

07:49.990 --> 07:52.430
Emilia might be involved.

07:54.090 --> 07:58.910
Anyway, you stay here with 
the sacred sword girl and behave.

08:00.660 --> 08:04.920
Good Albert, what did you mean by that?

08:04.920 --> 08:06.290
Mean by what?

08:06.290 --> 08:08.730
"Be grateful to Adramelech."

08:08.730 --> 08:10.800
Oh, that?

08:10.800 --> 08:13.510
The truth is, I've known for a while

08:13.510 --> 08:17.120
that the Devil's army wasn't 
just trying to kill all humans.

08:17.120 --> 08:20.180
And that demons can be reasonable.

08:21.430 --> 08:26.940
I guessed it when Adramelech's 
forces wiped the floor with us.

08:27.320 --> 08:29.940
I was prepared to die, and then...

08:29.940 --> 08:33.010
Our objective is not to commit massacres!

08:33.010 --> 08:36.570
Submit to our rule, and I'll guarantee 
the lives of your people.

08:38.370 --> 08:42.390
True, he slaughtered everyone 
who rose against him.

08:42.390 --> 08:45.690
But he never killed civilians for fun.

08:46.120 --> 08:50.500
Later, when we fought him 
again to defeat the Devil...

08:50.500 --> 08:53.010
Let me fight this one alone!

08:53.340 --> 08:54.890
Battle me one on one!

08:56.130 --> 09:00.350
I don't acknowledge anyone carried
 away by cheap pride as a warrior.

09:00.350 --> 09:03.390
Come, Hero and her companions!

09:05.390 --> 09:09.850
He was a better warrior <i>and</i> 
a better human being than me.

09:09.850 --> 09:13.330
Though I guess it's weird to 
call a demon a "human being."

09:14.930 --> 09:21.070
Adramelech wouldn't follow a king 
who was just some bloodthirsty beast.

09:21.070 --> 09:24.240
So when Emilia said she wouldn't kill Satan,

09:24.240 --> 09:26.790
I figured I was okay with observing

09:26.790 --> 09:30.290
just what sort of people 
these "demons" really are.

09:30.740 --> 09:34.070
They may not be much different from us.

09:34.070 --> 09:36.420
So, what now?

09:36.420 --> 09:38.740
With the Devil unable 
to use the sacred sword,

09:38.740 --> 09:42.500
it would be hard for us to openly 
take back Emilia and the others.

09:42.500 --> 09:44.360
Our mission has two objectives:

09:45.310 --> 09:49.120
Within the next twelve hours, 
we must free the Emperor-Unifier

09:49.120 --> 09:52.870
and rescue Nord Justina, 
the reason Emilia's hands are tied.

09:52.870 --> 09:56.320
We'll find them before 
the volunteer army does.

09:57.590 --> 10:02.330
You're suggesting we kidnap not just 
Emilia's dad, but the Emperor-Unifier too?!

10:02.730 --> 10:05.080
For us, it's not impossible.

10:05.080 --> 10:10.170
I've had enough of demons and humans 
fighting for reasons neither understand.

10:11.480 --> 10:14.630
We'll do what it takes to 
avoid their armies clashing.

10:18.500 --> 10:23.970
I know I gotta skip a turn, but I can't 
just sit here twiddling my thumbs.

10:23.970 --> 10:27.030
Lookie, Big Sis...

10:27.480 --> 10:29.590
Japanese Black wagyu...

10:29.590 --> 10:32.110
I will never feed you that.

10:32.110 --> 10:33.930
Hey! Wake up, Acieth!

10:34.480 --> 10:36.860
Y-Y-You startled me!

10:36.860 --> 10:42.460
What the heck, Maou? I was about 
to eat Iberico pork pastrami!

10:42.460 --> 10:44.490
What happened to the wagyu?

10:44.490 --> 10:47.000
Come on, let's go train.

10:47.000 --> 10:52.250
I'm not doing well either, 
you know. I'm so hungry!

10:53.500 --> 10:56.380
Explain this to me from the beginning.

10:56.920 --> 11:01.060
Why do you and Alas Ramus fuse with us?

11:01.060 --> 11:03.880
You said something about mistletoe before.

11:03.880 --> 11:07.500
Pass me that stew.

11:09.200 --> 11:12.900
You're sorely mistaken if you think 
you'll get answers that easily, mwahaha.

11:12.900 --> 11:13.860
Excuse me?

11:13.860 --> 11:15.990
I dunno either!

11:15.990 --> 11:19.030
I dunno why I can fuse with you or Dad,

11:19.030 --> 11:22.410
just that it's something I need to do.

11:22.410 --> 11:24.930
I don't think any of the others know, either.

11:24.930 --> 11:26.230
Others?

11:26.230 --> 11:31.040
Didn't Big Sis tell you 
about Malkuth or Geburah?

11:31.040 --> 11:35.000
Oh, them. Do they take human form, too?

11:35.000 --> 11:38.660
Malkuth is the smartest one of us.

11:38.660 --> 11:41.930
Malkuth's the one who taught us 
the word "mistletoe."

11:42.260 --> 11:44.430
So where are they now?

11:44.430 --> 11:48.890
Dunno. It's been a super long 
time since I talked to them.

11:48.890 --> 11:50.810
The melancholy face doesn't really work

11:50.810 --> 11:54.060
when your cheeks stuffed 
with food like a squirrel's.

11:54.060 --> 11:55.310
But listen...

11:56.940 --> 12:01.390
We're one step away from Alas 
Ramus now. We gotta do our best.

12:01.390 --> 12:03.320
Darn... you got me.

12:03.930 --> 12:08.550
I'll train, but it'll make me hungry,
 so I'll eat ten more buns!

12:08.550 --> 12:11.030
Hey, Pops! More bean-jam buns!

12:12.710 --> 12:14.110
I can't go on...

12:14.110 --> 12:16.920
You are such a disappointment!

12:18.710 --> 12:21.960
Oh, those are for warding off evil.

12:21.960 --> 12:26.300
Everyone's worried that the peace 
of our nation might crumble again.

12:26.970 --> 12:30.350
Here, your leftover buns and 
some of those firecrackers.

12:30.350 --> 12:32.840
Take them as a souvenir. They're good luck.

12:32.840 --> 12:34.480
A souvenir, huh?

12:35.410 --> 12:36.720
Hey, Acieth.

12:36.720 --> 12:38.890
Huh? Can't train.

12:39.310 --> 12:41.290
We'll take a walk to help you digest.

12:42.010 --> 12:43.490
What kinda walk?

12:43.490 --> 12:44.900
A shopping trip.

12:50.350 --> 12:54.610
Mama, this corn soup isn't like Suzu-sis's.

12:54.610 --> 12:56.880
Oh. Okay, how's this?

12:59.720 --> 13:01.870
Not like Alciel's.

13:01.870 --> 13:06.070
Oh... Please eat anyway, okay, Alas Ramus?

13:06.600 --> 13:08.170
You like fried chicken, right?

13:08.170 --> 13:10.500
I want Chi-sis's!

13:11.170 --> 13:14.000
Let's have them make us dinner 
again when we go home, okay?

13:14.000 --> 13:15.390
So for now...

13:16.020 --> 13:17.650
When can we go home?

13:19.180 --> 13:22.310
I know food isn't as good 
when we're not all together.

13:23.310 --> 13:24.650
But we have to eat.

13:25.540 --> 13:26.660
Emilia...

13:26.660 --> 13:28.440
It's time for a war council.

13:30.500 --> 13:32.900
You buy this stuff, Maou?

13:32.900 --> 13:35.430
It doesn't seem like you.

13:35.430 --> 13:39.290
It's not for me. 
We're buying Chi a souvenir.

13:39.290 --> 13:41.360
A souvenir for Chiho?

13:41.360 --> 13:43.920
Do we really have time for that?

13:43.920 --> 13:46.740
You're one to talk.

13:47.140 --> 13:51.930
We have to throw a birthday party 
when we get back. For Chi and Emi.

13:51.930 --> 13:55.050
Emi is the one Big Sis fused with, right?

13:55.050 --> 13:59.060
Yep. We should've done 
the party a while ago.

13:59.620 --> 14:02.610
And I don't want Chi to be sad.

14:08.200 --> 14:12.130
That's why you're buying Chiho 
a present with Suzuno's money?

14:12.130 --> 14:13.080
Ow!

14:13.080 --> 14:15.380
I'm gonna pay her back in yen later!

14:15.380 --> 14:20.980
Wait, I know Suzuno and Chiho are 
your friends, but is Emi your friend too?

14:20.980 --> 14:26.030
I have a feeling Chi'll be sad 
if I don't get a present for Emi.

14:26.030 --> 14:28.720
Who is Emi to you, Maou?

14:28.720 --> 14:32.820
Good question. There's some 
complicated stuff involving Alas Ramus,

14:32.820 --> 14:38.230
but to me, she's... yeah, 
"rival" fits the best, I think.

14:38.230 --> 14:39.600
Rival?

14:39.600 --> 14:43.230
Emi treats me like she's my equal or better.

14:43.650 --> 14:45.750
Everything I lack, she has.

14:45.750 --> 14:47.620
I don't want to lose to her.

14:47.620 --> 14:50.360
And she calls me her archenemy, after all.

14:51.600 --> 14:55.970
But you're giving her a present 
on her birthday? I don't get it.

14:56.280 --> 14:58.870
Hey Acieth, these are good, right?

14:59.250 --> 15:01.880
They're both practical and cute.

15:01.880 --> 15:03.750
Sure, why not?

15:04.130 --> 15:05.780
Okay, I'm going with these.

15:07.940 --> 15:09.220
I'm ready to pay.

15:09.220 --> 15:10.380
You got it.

15:10.380 --> 15:15.140
Now, Acieth, is your stomach 
about settled down?

15:19.520 --> 15:21.520
No! Not inside!

15:27.650 --> 15:30.780
Acieth, what's wrong?! What just happened?!

15:31.270 --> 15:35.270
You're reacting so strongly—
is it Alas Ramus's influence?

15:35.270 --> 15:39.360
Damn it, Suzuno and Albert 
better not have messed up!

15:40.180 --> 15:45.020
Acieth! Let's land and—
Hey, no! Not from this height!

15:56.390 --> 15:57.590
Lady Emilia!

15:58.250 --> 15:59.410
What is it?

15:59.410 --> 16:01.680
I have a message from 
the advance troops in Heavensky.

16:01.680 --> 16:03.490
Please don't panic.

16:03.490 --> 16:05.340
Well, let's have it.

16:05.340 --> 16:07.560
I know it's hard to believe,

16:07.560 --> 16:11.950
but they report that Demon General Alciel
 is in Heavensky's castle tower.

16:11.950 --> 16:15.050
What?! Ashiya—er, Alciel?

16:15.050 --> 16:16.200
Is this true?

16:16.200 --> 16:19.730
Yes. He suddenly appeared 
there several days ago.

16:19.730 --> 16:22.580
Sources say he's lying in wait for our army.

16:22.580 --> 16:25.210
And the Devil? Is Satan there?!

16:25.210 --> 16:31.210
No, no reports of him... 
But didn't you defeat him, ma'am?

16:31.210 --> 16:34.010
Yes... Yes, of course.

16:34.010 --> 16:38.470
In any case, Alciel is no 
match for you on his own.

16:38.470 --> 16:43.230
The volunteer army, led by Emilia the Hero, 
will wipe all demons from this land.

16:43.230 --> 16:47.380
After that, we'll defeat 
Demon General Alciel in Heavensky

16:47.380 --> 16:50.080
and save the Emperor-Unifier.

16:50.080 --> 16:52.240
<i>This</i> time, we'll get Alciel.

16:53.950 --> 16:56.490
So that's my role here.

16:58.690 --> 17:00.490
Alciel is here?

17:01.190 --> 17:04.000
Is Papa here, too?

17:05.030 --> 17:06.580
Papa, too?

17:06.930 --> 17:10.250
Papa... the Devil...

17:11.110 --> 17:12.880
What's the matter, Emilia?

17:13.990 --> 17:18.300
Sorry, I'm going to skip 
the meeting. I don't feel well.

17:18.730 --> 17:22.610
I'll fight the strongest enemy myself. 
That's all you want, right?

17:22.610 --> 17:24.130
Lady Emilia?

17:31.340 --> 17:34.280
What's wrong with me?!

17:34.920 --> 17:41.770
No matter what, he's my... 
He's my father's...

17:42.120 --> 17:44.410
I'll show you a whole new world.

17:45.030 --> 17:48.670
He's my enemy... so why?

17:48.670 --> 17:50.230
It's not right.

17:50.600 --> 17:53.550
I hate this. <i>Why</i>?!

17:53.550 --> 17:56.910
Why are you coming so deep into my heart?!

17:56.910 --> 17:58.390
Screw you!

17:58.800 --> 18:01.370
Mama, Papa will come!

18:01.370 --> 18:04.010
He can pat us on the head! 'Kay?

18:04.970 --> 18:08.940
Right... He'll come.

18:13.050 --> 18:18.510
I don't know! I don't know 
what to do anymore.

18:18.510 --> 18:22.830
Satan... Satan, help me!

18:24.150 --> 18:28.440
Eme, Al, I'm sorry...

18:28.440 --> 18:31.690
Dad, I'm sorry!

18:31.690 --> 18:35.340
I can't fight alone anymore!

18:41.090 --> 18:42.120
Mama...

18:43.870 --> 18:46.440
I'm sorry, Alas Ramus.

18:46.440 --> 18:49.820
But it looks like I've hit my limit...

18:54.750 --> 18:57.560
I was all alone, too.

18:58.360 --> 19:01.870
But now I'm with you, Mama.

19:01.870 --> 19:03.280
And Papa.

19:03.280 --> 19:09.120
And Chi-sis, Alciel, Suzu-sis, 
Lucifer, Eme-sis...

19:09.500 --> 19:11.620
They're all with you.

19:11.620 --> 19:14.130
Acieth, too.

19:14.130 --> 19:15.850
Alas Ramus?

19:16.500 --> 19:21.990
So it's okay! We'll be with them again soon!

19:22.680 --> 19:25.640
Yes, you're right.

19:25.640 --> 19:29.260
We were all together, weren't we?

19:30.180 --> 19:32.150
But it's too late.

19:32.740 --> 19:38.170
I let a lot of demons die by obeying Olba.

19:38.490 --> 19:42.100
I doubt the Devil and Alciel will forgive me.

19:42.980 --> 19:47.040
Lady Emilia, I apologize 
for interrupting while you're unwell.

19:49.160 --> 19:50.790
She has arrived.

19:51.700 --> 19:53.270
There you are, Emilia.

19:53.270 --> 19:55.760
I hear we received a letter from Alciel.

19:55.760 --> 19:57.420
May I see it?

19:57.790 --> 19:59.250
Please be careful.

19:59.250 --> 20:02.670
It's written in a mysterious language—
it may be a curse.

20:05.750 --> 20:08.350
I don't think this is a curse.

20:08.350 --> 20:10.430
What does it say, then?

20:10.840 --> 20:13.470
You can't read this, Olba?

20:13.470 --> 20:16.680
I'm well aware it's 
in the other world's "kanji."

20:16.680 --> 20:19.680
But all I can make out is "chilled,"

20:19.680 --> 20:21.130
the kanji for "luggage,"

20:21.130 --> 20:25.450
and an idiom expressing a desire for revenge.

20:25.920 --> 20:27.950
What does it say?!

20:27.950 --> 20:30.200
I don't really understand it myself.

20:30.600 --> 20:34.900
It says, "I vow to pay you back 
for the hiyayakko and ginger bud."

20:34.900 --> 20:36.520
Hiyayakko? Ginger bud?

20:36.520 --> 20:39.530
They're foods. Hiyayakko is chilled tofu.

20:39.530 --> 20:42.290
It's white and jiggly, and it
 doesn't have much flavor.

20:42.290 --> 20:45.720
A ginger bud is kind of a reddish purple bulb,

20:45.720 --> 20:47.530
and it's really bitter when you chew it.

20:47.530 --> 20:50.660
They sound like demonic ingredients.

20:50.660 --> 20:55.540
They're tasty! If you slice the ginger 
and put it on... chilled tofu...

21:03.300 --> 21:06.490
It's the Devil who's coming to pay me back.

21:06.490 --> 21:08.370
What's the matter, Emilia?

21:08.370 --> 21:10.800
Let's go to Heavensky at once.

21:10.800 --> 21:12.020
Excuse me?

21:12.020 --> 21:16.620
It's a code. Alciel is telling us to 
withdraw our troops if we want to survive.

21:16.620 --> 21:19.680
What?! Could that be a bluff?

21:19.680 --> 21:25.740
No. Alciel can use chilled tofu and ginger 
to gain a power far surpassing Satan's.

21:25.740 --> 21:27.140
U-Unbelievable!

21:27.580 --> 21:29.430
We have to hurry, or it'll be too late.

21:30.030 --> 21:31.760
Very well.

21:34.310 --> 21:36.570
<i>I guess he's not just some guy</i>

21:36.570 --> 21:40.570
<i>who tries to buy multiple 
"one per person" discount egg packs.</i>

21:43.250 --> 21:46.490
<i>The Devil is coming. For me.</i>

21:47.260 --> 21:50.030
<i>I have to do what I can until then.</i>

21:50.410 --> 21:52.780
Better, Mama?

21:53.170 --> 21:56.120
Yes, somehow I'm starting to feel better.

21:58.730 --> 22:02.050
<i>He probably won't forgive what I've done,</i>

22:02.770 --> 22:05.970
<i>and this time we'll probably 
end up utter enemies.</i>

22:05.970 --> 22:07.230
But still...
